---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import DownloadPanel from '../components/DownloadPanel.astro';
import downloads from '../data/downloads.json';
const availableFiles=downloads.files.filter(f=>f.id!=='windows-arm64');
const softwareSchema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'SoftwareApplication',name:'Audacity',softwareVersion:downloads.version,operatingSystem:'Windows 10, Windows 11',applicationCategory:'MultimediaApplication',url:'https://www.audacityteam.org/',downloadUrl:'https://audacitycn.com/download/',isAccessibleForFree:true,offers:{'@type':'Offer',price:'0',priceCurrency:'USD'}};
---
<Base title={`Audacity ${downloads.version} 网盘下载：安装版与便携版`} description="通过夸克、百度、UC 网盘下载 Audacity 4.0.1 Windows x64 原始安装版和便携版。提供分享二维码、提取码、原始文件名、SHA-256 与安装说明。" breadcrumbs={[{name:'下载',path:'/download/'}]}>
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(softwareSchema)} />
<div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="当前位置"><a href="/">首页</a> / 下载</nav><h1>Audacity {downloads.version} 网盘下载</h1><p class="lead">选择下方网盘，扫码或打开分享链接获取原始文件。网盘中包含 Windows x64 安装版、便携版、对应源码、许可证与校验文件。</p></header>
<div class="download-summary"><strong>{downloads.version}</strong><span>免费开源</span><span>来源核对：<time datetime={downloads.verified}>{downloads.verified}</time></span><span>原始发布文件，未重新打包</span></div>
<DownloadPanel />
<section class="download-info"><h2>文件名与校验值</h2><p>普通 Intel / AMD 电脑使用 Windows x64。下载后按文件名核对版本；校验值用于检查从网盘保存的文件是否完整。</p>{availableFiles.map(f=><section class="file-reference"><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>{f.description}</p><code class="file-name">{new URL(f.url).pathname.split('/').pop()}</code><details class="checksum"><summary>查看 SHA-256</summary><code>{f.sha256}</code><button class="copy" data-copy={f.sha256}>复制校验值</button></details></section>)}<h2>安装版和便携版有什么区别？</h2><p>MSI 按安装向导部署。7Z 需要完整解压后运行，不要只把可执行文件单独拖出来。工作中的工程先保存在本机磁盘，完成后再备份。</p><h2>下载之后做什么？</h2><ul><li><a href="/guides/install/">按安装教程检查架构和首次启动。</a></li><li><a href="/guides/record-voice/">用 10 秒录音检查麦克风和电平。</a></li><li><a href="/guides/export-audio/">保存工程，再导出 MP3 或 WAV。</a></li></ul><p class="fine">文件来源：Audacity 项目的官方发布记录。本站提供网盘分享入口。</p></section>
</div></Base>
